WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.322
At least 40% of your account always stays parked in uncommitted cash,

2
00:00:04.322 --> 00:00:08.894
and conservative Quarter-Kelly sizing keeps every single position modest.

3
00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:09.457
Remember:

4
00:00:09.457 --> 00:00:12.589
that 40% cushion keeps you from ever being all-in,

5
00:00:12.589 --> 00:00:16.848
though the active 60% working in markets can still move up and down.
